@startuml
' Diagrams inside a diagram (REQ-077): drawn as pictures in a note and
' in a legend, in the outer diagram's skinparams.
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
Alice -> Bob : hello
note right
  The handshake inside:
  {{
    Bob -> Carol : ask
    Carol --> Bob : answer
  }}
end note
Bob --> Alice : done
legend
  {{wbs
  * Release
  ** Build
  ** Ship
  }}
endlegend
@enduml
